<h1>Points & Miles Calculators</h1>
<p class="sub">Whether you are checking points valuations, converting bank points to airline miles, or deciding if an award flight or hotel is worth booking, our suite of specialized tools has you covered.</p>

<div class="article-content prose" style="margin-top: 1.5rem;">
  <h2>Choose the Right Calculator for Your Task</h2>
  <p>Award travel calculations serve different purposes depending on whether you are estimating portfolio wealth, planning bank transfers, or evaluating an active booking:</p>

  <div class="tool-summary-card" style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem; padding: 1.25rem; background: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 8px;">
    <h3 style="margin-top: 0;"><a href="/en/calculators/points-to-dollars/">Miles to Dollars Calculator</a></h3>
    <p>Converts an accumulated mileage or points balance into an estimated monetary value across conservative, typical, and high-value scenarios.</p>
    <ul style="margin: 0.5rem 0 0 1.25rem; font-size: 0.95rem;">
      <li><strong>Input:</strong> Points balance and CPP assumption (e.g. 1.2¢, 1.5¢, 2.0¢)</li>
      <li><strong>Output:</strong> Estimated total dollar value and portfolio valuation</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="tool-summary-card" style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem; padding: 1.25rem; background: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 8px;">
    <h3 style="margin-top: 0;"><a href="/en/calculators/points-to-miles-converter/">Points to Miles Converter</a></h3>
    <p>Performs a forward calculation to determine the exact number of airline miles you will receive when transferring credit card rewards.</p>
    <ul style="margin: 0.5rem 0 0 1.25rem; font-size: 0.95rem;">
      <li><strong>Input:</strong> Bank points, base transfer ratio, transfer increment, and bonus percentage</li>
      <li><strong>Output:</strong> Total airline miles received and remaining points</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="tool-summary-card" style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem; padding: 1.25rem; background: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 8px;">
    <h3 style="margin-top: 0;"><a href="/en/calculators/transfer-bonus/">Transfer Bonus Calculator</a></h3>
    <p>Reverse-calculates the exact minimum number of flexible bank points needed to reach a specific frequent flyer mileage target during promotions.</p>
    <ul style="margin: 0.5rem 0 0 1.25rem; font-size: 0.95rem;">
      <li><strong>Input:</strong> Target airline miles required for an award flight</li>
      <li><strong>Output:</strong> Bank points required to transfer</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="tool-summary-card" style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem; padding: 1.25rem; background: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 8px;">
    <h3 style="margin-top: 0;"><a href="/en/calculators/points-vs-cash/">Points vs Cash Calculator</a></h3>
    <p>Compares an award redemption against paying cash, factoring in co-pay taxes and the forgone rewards you would have earned on a paid ticket.</p>
    <ul style="margin: 0.5rem 0 0 1.25rem; font-size: 0.95rem;">
      <li><strong>Input:</strong> Cash ticket price, award points required, taxes/fees, and baseline valuation</li>
      <li><strong>Output:</strong> Net cash difference and booking recommendation</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="tool-summary-card" style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem; padding: 1.25rem; background: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 8px;">
    <h3 style="margin-top: 0;"><a href="/en/calculators/hotel-points-vs-cash/">Hotel Points vs Cash Calculator</a></h3>
    <p>Enter the stay’s cash price and points required to compare CPP, out-of-pocket cost, and the better option under your assumptions.</p>
    <ul style="margin: 0.5rem 0 0 1.25rem; font-size: 0.95rem;">
      <li><strong>Input:</strong> Total cash price, total points required, award taxes/fees, and personal valuation</li>
      <li><strong>Output:</strong> Actual CPP, out-of-pocket cost, net avoided cash spend, and recommendation</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="tool-summary-card" style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem; padding: 1.25rem; background: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 8px;">
    <h3 style="margin-top: 0;"><a href="/en/calculators/cents-per-point/">Cents Per Point (CPP) Calculator</a></h3>
    <p>Quickly computes the precise unit redemption rate of any award booking to see if it exceeds common editorial benchmarks.</p>
    <ul style="margin: 0.5rem 0 0 1.25rem; font-size: 0.95rem;">
      <li><strong>Input:</strong> Cash ticket price, cash taxes on award, and points required</li>
      <li><strong>Output:</strong> Exact Cents Per Point (CPP)</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="tool-summary-card" style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem; padding: 1.25rem; background: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 8px;">
    <h3 style="margin-top: 0;"><a href="/en/calculators/trip-cost-after-points/">Trip Cost After Points Calculator</a></h3>
    <p>Models the total net out-of-pocket cash requirements for an entire vacation combining flights, hotels, taxes, and daily ground expenses.</p>
    <ul style="margin: 0.5rem 0 0 1.25rem; font-size: 0.95rem;">
      <li><strong>Input:</strong> Flight/hotel points and cash costs, duration, group size, and daily expenses</li>
      <li><strong>Output:</strong> Comprehensive out-of-pocket cash total and savings breakdown</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="tool-summary-card" style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem; padding: 1.25rem; background: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 8px;">
    <h3 style="margin-top: 0;"><a href="/en/calculators/buy-points/">Buy Points Calculator</a></h3>
    <p>Evaluates points and miles purchase promotions to determine your true acquisition cost per point and assess whether purchasing points beats paying cash directly.</p>
    <ul style="margin: 0.5rem 0 0 1.25rem; font-size: 0.95rem;">
      <li><strong>Input:</strong> Total purchase cost, total points acquired with bonuses, and cash price of target redemption</li>
      <li><strong>Output:</strong> Acquisition cost per point (CPP) and break-even financial verdict</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>

